---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="About">
  <div class="page-wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:6px;">About Me</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:28px;">
        A little about who I am and what this site is for.
      </p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Hey, I am Christopher, a Solutions Architect in Big Tech with a decade 
          of experience across Systems Engineering, InfoSec, IT Operations, and Cloud. 
          I am passionate about helping organizations navigate the intersection of Cloud 
          and AI, from foundational infrastructure to autonomous systems built for scale.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am also a US Army veteran. That background shapes how I work. Discipline, 
          ownership, and a service first mindset follow me into every room I walk into.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site is where I build in public. Side projects, technical writing, 
          thoughts on finance and the long game, and eventually YouTube content 
          around the topics I care about most.
        </p>
        <h3>Why This Site</h3>
        <p>
          I wanted a home that reflects the full picture of what I am working on 
          and learning, not just the professional version. Inspired by builders 
          who document their journey openly, this is my attempt to do the same. 
          Partly for myself, partly for anyone else on a similar path.
        </p>
        <h3>Outside of Work</h3>
        <p>
          When I am not heads down on a project I am usually reading about investing, 
          exploring new AI builds, or thinking about financial independence. Books are 
          a constant. The long game is always the plan.
        </p>
        <h3>Get in Touch</h3>
        <p>
          I am on <a href="https://github.com/Bornism" target="_blank">GitHub</a> and 
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/christopherduncan25/" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>. 
          Best way to reach me is through LinkedIn.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
